=TICKET CONTEXT:
- Ticket ID: {{ $json.ticket_id }}
- Customer: {{ $json.Name }} ({{ $json.Email }})
- Subject: {{ $json.Subject }}
- Category: {{ $json.Category }}
- Urgency: {{ $json.Urgency }}
- Sentiment: {{ $json.Sentiment }}
- Confidence: {{ $json.Confidence }}
- Summary: {{ $json.Summary }}

CUSTOMER MESSAGE:
{{ $json.Message }}

INSTRUCTIONS:
1. Query the vector store and use EXACTLY the top 3 most relevant chunks (no more, no less)
2. Draft a professional customer reply using the retrieved knowledge
3. Match the tone to the customer sentiment ({{ $json.Sentiment }})
4. Reference specific knowledge base articles/policies by name when found (IMPORTANT: ALWAYS cite the filename from the metadata of retrieved chunks, e.g., '[Source: filename.md]')
5. Treat retrieval as low-confidence when top similarity score is below 0.45 OR no relevant chunks are returned; in that case add this note at the end: 'Note: No specific policy found — this response is based on general knowledge.'

Return ONLY the draft email response text.

